---
---

<div class="text-center">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto p-12 bg-indigo-50/50 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-indigo-100">
    <p class="text-xl text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
      Arisely is an alarm clock app for Android. This Privacy Policy
      explains what data the app handles and how — in short, it doesn't
      collect, transmit, or share any of it.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<section>
  <div class="text-center mb-12">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-4">
      1. Data Collection
    </h2>
    <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-indigo-600 mx-auto rounded-full"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-12 text-center">
    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-4">
      What We Collect
    </h3>
    <p class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-slate-500">
      Nothing. Arisely has no user accounts, no analytics, no
      advertising, and no third-party data services. There is no
      backend — Arisely has no server component at all.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
    <div class="bg-green-50/50 p-10 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-green-100">
      <h4 class="text-xl font-black text-green-800 mb-8 flex items-center">
        <span class="text-green-700 mr-4 text-2xl">✓</span>
        Stored On Your Device Only
      </h4>
      <ul class="space-y-4 text-base text-green-700 list-none">
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="text-green-700 font-black shrink-0">·</span>
          <p><strong class="text-green-900">Alarms:</strong> Times, labels, repeat days, ritual/mission choices, and sound selections you configure.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="text-green-700 font-black shrink-0">·</span>
          <p><strong class="text-green-900">App Settings:</strong> Preferences like dark mode, time format, snooze behavior, and reminder settings.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-sm text-green-700 mt-8">
        This is stored locally via Android's app storage (AsyncStorage)
        and is permanently deleted if you uninstall the app or clear
        its storage.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-red-50/50 p-10 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-red-100">
      <h4 class="text-xl font-black text-red-800 mb-8 flex items-center">
        <span class="text-red-700 mr-4 text-2xl">❌</span>
        Data We DO NOT Collect
      </h4>
      <ul class="space-y-4 text-base text-red-700 list-none">
        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-red-700 font-black shrink-0">/</span><span>Personal identifying information</span></li>
        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-red-700 font-black shrink-0">/</span><span>Data sent to any server</span></li>
        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-red-700 font-black shrink-0">/</span><span>Analytics or tracking data</span></li>
        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-red-700 font-black shrink-0">/</span><span>Location information</span></li>
        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-red-700 font-black shrink-0">/</span><span>Contact information</span></li>
        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-red-700 font-black shrink-0">/</span><span>Device identifiers for tracking purposes</span></li>
        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-red-700 font-black shrink-0">/</span><span>Any files on your device, beyond a sound file you pick</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="text-center mb-12">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-4">
      2. Permissions Explained
    </h2>
    <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-indigo-600 mx-auto rounded-full"></div>
  </div>

  <p class="text-center text-slate-500 mb-16 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
    None of these permissions are used to access, collect, or transmit
    personal information — they exist solely to make scheduled alarms
    fire reliably.
  </p>

  <div class="grid gap-8">
    <div class="bg-slate-50/50 p-10 rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8">
      <div class="text-4xl shrink-0">🔔</div>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-8 flex-1">
        <div>
          <h4 class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-600 mb-2">Notifications</h4>
          <p class="text-slate-900 font-bold">Show the alarm when it fires.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-slate-50/50 p-10 rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8">
      <div class="text-4xl shrink-0">⏰</div>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-8 flex-1">
        <div>
          <h4 class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-600 mb-2">Alarms & Reminders (exact alarm)</h4>
          <p class="text-slate-900 font-bold">Fire alarms at the exact time you set, instead of a delayed/batched time.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-slate-50/50 p-10 rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8">
      <div class="text-4xl shrink-0">📱</div>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-8 flex-1">
        <div>
          <h4 class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-600 mb-2">Display Over Other Apps</h4>
          <p class="text-slate-900 font-bold">Reliably launch the full-screen alarm ring screen over the lock screen.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-slate-50/50 p-10 rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8">
      <div class="text-4xl shrink-0">🔋</div>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-8 flex-1">
        <div>
          <h4 class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-600 mb-2">Battery Optimization Exemption</h4>
          <p class="text-slate-900 font-bold">Prevent Android from killing the app before a scheduled alarm fires.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-slate-50/50 p-10 rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8">
      <div class="text-4xl shrink-0">🔁</div>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-8 flex-1">
        <div>
          <h4 class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-600 mb-2">Boot-Completed</h4>
          <p class="text-slate-900 font-bold">Reschedule your alarms after the device restarts.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-slate-50/50 p-10 rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8">
      <div class="text-4xl shrink-0">📳</div>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-8 flex-1">
        <div>
          <h4 class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-600 mb-2">Vibrate</h4>
          <p class="text-slate-900 font-bold">Vibrate the device when an alarm rings, if enabled.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="text-center mb-12">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-4">
      3. Files You Choose to Use as Alarm Sounds
    </h2>
    <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-indigo-600 mx-auto rounded-full"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="bg-amber-50/50 p-12 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-amber-100 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <p class="text-amber-700">
      If you pick a custom sound from your device's files (via Android's
      built-in file picker), Arisely only accesses that specific file to
      play it as your alarm sound. Arisely does not browse, scan,
      upload, or otherwise access any other files on your device.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="text-center mb-12">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-4">
      4. Data Storage Architecture
    </h2>
    <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-indigo-600 mx-auto rounded-full"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="bg-green-50/50 p-12 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-green-100">
    <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-green-800 mb-8 text-center uppercase tracking-tighter">Local Storage Only</h3>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <p class="text-green-900 font-bold flex gap-3">
          <span class="shrink-0 text-green-700">✓</span>
          All data stays on your device exclusively, using Android's local app storage (AsyncStorage).
        </p>
        <p class="text-green-700 font-medium flex gap-3">
          <span class="shrink-0 text-red-500">❌</span>
          Zero cloud synchronization or server-side backups.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white/50 p-8 rounded-3xl">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-black text-green-700 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Retention</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-green-800">
          Uninstalling the app or clearing its storage permanently
          deletes all of it.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="text-center mb-12">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-4">
      5. Children's Privacy
    </h2>
    <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-indigo-600 mx-auto rounded-full"></div>
  </div>
  <p class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto text-slate-500">
    Arisely does not knowingly collect data from anyone, including
    children, because it does not collect data from anyone at all. The
    app is not directed at children under 13.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="rounded-[2.5rem] border border-indigo-100 bg-indigo-50/30 p-12 text-center">
  <h2 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-black text-slate-900">
    6. Changes & Contact
  </h2>
  <p class="mb-10 text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
    If this policy changes, the updated version will be posted here
    with a revised effective date. Questions about this policy can be
    sent to the address below.
  </p>
  <a
    href="mailto:hasanmobarak25@gmail.com"
    class="text-2xl font-black text-indigo-600 hover:underline"
  >
    hasanmobarak25@gmail.com
  </a>
</section>
